WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.505
Welcome to PollSlide!

2
00:00:01.505 --> 00:00:09.517
In the next two minutes, you'll make your first quiz, let Polly write questions for you, add GIFs, and run it live with your audience.

3
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:12.256
Start by choosing what to make.

4
00:00:12.256 --> 00:00:14.218
Polls ask the room what it thinks.

5
00:00:14.218 --> 00:00:16.814
Quizzes have right answers and a leaderboard.

6
00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:17.853
Let's make a quiz.

7
00:00:18.806 --> 00:00:20.919
Click Blank Quiz, and give it a name.

8
00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.088
Everything you do saves automatically.

9
00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:25.768
Now add your first question.

10
00:00:25.768 --> 00:00:29.288
Type it in, fill in the answers, then tick the right one.

11
00:00:29.288 --> 00:00:33.055
Polls work exactly the same way, just without a right answer.

12
00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:35.679
Now make it fun.

13
00:00:35.679 --> 00:00:39.816
Tap GIF, search for anything you like, and pick one for your question.

14
00:00:39.816 --> 00:00:42.003
Each answer can have its own GIF too.

15
00:00:42.003 --> 00:00:45.490
They look great on the big screen, and on everyone's phone.

16
00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:52.721
Short on time? Ask Polly.

17
00:00:52.721 --> 00:00:59.994
Describe your topic, choose how many questions, and Polly writes them for you, with the right answers already marked.

18
00:00:59.994 --> 00:01:02.729
Free accounts get five Polly drafts a month.

19
00:01:04.994 --> 00:01:06.525
Want pictures everywhere?

20
00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:11.854
Open the deck menu, choose GIFs, and PollSlide finds one for every question and answer.

21
00:01:11.854 --> 00:01:16.142
Safe search is always on, and you review them before anyone sees them.

22
00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:23.208
When you're ready, press Present.

23
00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.229
Your audience scans the QR code with their phones.

24
00:01:26.229 --> 00:01:27.377
No app, no sign up.

25
00:01:27.377 --> 00:01:29.552
Answers appear live as they come in.

26
00:01:29.552 --> 00:01:32.512
Then reveal the answer, and see who got it right!

27
00:01:43.452 --> 00:01:44.104
That's it!

28
00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:47.105
Open PollSlide and make your first quiz today.

29
00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:50.954
And if you ever need a hand, just email help@pollslide.com.
